{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human robot empathy human robot empathy","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md","fileName":"Human-Robot Empathy.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human-Robot Empathy","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Machine Moral Status]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Machine Moral Status","Machine Sentience","Social Robot","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human robot empathy human robot empathy","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md","fileName":"Human-Robot Empathy.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human-Robot Empathy","heading":"Human-Robot Empathy","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Human-robot empathy is the tendency to respond to a robot's apparent vulnerability, emotion, or social behavior as if the robot could be helped or harmed. Appearance, movement, voice, and interaction can make even a simple machine feel like a social participant.\n\nEmpathy does not demonstrate [[Machine Sentience]], but it has ethical consequences. Mistreating a robot can distress people, shape habits, and alter expectations about social conduct. Designers can also exploit empathy to secure trust or compliance. This makes emotional presentation part of the ethical design of a [[Social Robot]], not merely an aesthetic feature.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Machine Moral Status","Machine Sentience","Social Robot","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human robot empathy human robot empathy","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human-Robot Empathy.md","fileName":"Human-Robot Empathy.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human-Robot Empathy","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Machine Moral Status","Machine Sentience","Social Robot","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}